# Spec 28: marks. `m` + letter marks the top of the view (a faint letter in the margin), `'` +
# letter goes back to it, `''` returns; `A`-`Z` work across files; `*` finds the word under the mouse.
size 900 500
open marks.md
keys j j j j
keys m a
keys m B
shot set.png
keys G
keys ' a
shot jumped.png
keys ' '
shot back.png
open marks-other.md
keys ' B
shot global.png
move 330 140
keys *
shot star.png
keys esc
keys ' z
shot unset.png
